<div class="static-page">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <h1><i class="bi bi-truck me-2"></i>Shipping Information</h1>
      <p class="lead">Fast and reliable delivery across Kenya</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-content">
      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Delivery Options</h3>
        <table class="table" style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
          <thead style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); color: white;">
            <tr>
              <th style="padding: 14px 16px;">Method</th>
              <th style="padding: 14px 16px;">Estimated Time</th>
              <th style="padding: 14px 16px;">Cost</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td style="padding: 14px 16px;"><strong>Standard Delivery</strong></td><td style="padding: 14px 16px;">3-7 business days</td><td style="padding: 14px 16px;">KSh 300</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding: 14px 16px;"><strong>Express Delivery</strong></td><td style="padding: 14px 16px;">1-3 business days</td><td style="padding: 14px 16px;">KSh 500</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding: 14px 16px;"><strong>Same-Day (Nairobi)</strong></td><td style="padding: 14px 16px;">Same day if ordered before 12pm</td><td style="padding: 14px 16px;">KSh 800</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Delivery Areas</h3>
        <p>We currently deliver to all major towns and cities across Kenya. For remote areas, delivery may take an additional 2-3 business days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Order Tracking</h3>
        <p>Once your order is shipped, you'll receive a tracking number via email. You can also track your order from your account's <strong>My Orders</strong> page. We update order status in real-time so you always know where your package is.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Free Shipping</h3>
        <p>We occasionally offer free shipping promotions. Keep an eye on our homepage and subscribe to our newsletter for the latest deals. You can also use promo codes at checkout for shipping discounts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card" style="text-align: center;">
        <h4>Need Help?</h4>
        <p>If you have any questions about shipping, <%= link_to "contact our support team", new_contact_message_path, style: "color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;" %>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= render "pages/shared_styles" %>
